ga0s(){return"Soaks up damage before <hp>HP</hp> is lost."},
ga0t(){return"A shield is a cushion made of a part of the max <hp>HP</hp>. Damage hits the shield first and only then the <hp>HP</hp>. A shield has no duration and stays until it is used up. Every shield also reduces all damage taken by at least 5 % as long as something is left of it. Then the damage reduction icon shows."},
