ga_J(){return"Removes all debuffs."},
ga_K(){return"Cleanse removes every debuff from the target at once, for example poison, stun and all reductions of <atk>attack</atk>, <def>defense</def> and <spd>speed</spd>. Buffs and shields stay."},
