UM(a){return"When it falls, it <fx:heal>heals</fx> all living allies by "+a+" % of their max <hp>HP</hp> and removes all their [!debuffs!]. Anything above full <hp>HP</hp> becomes a <fx:shield>shield</fx>. Once per battle."},
