Vf(a){return"Every hit lowers [!the <def>defense</def> of the target by "+a+" %!] until the battle ends, up to 3 times. <fx:cleanse>Cleanse</fx> removes it."},
UR(a){return u.be+a+" % more damage]] to enemies below 30 % <hp>HP</hp>."},
V0(a){return"If one of its moves lands at least one crit, it then gets [["+a+" % turn meter]]."},
